    {
      "id": "instructions",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Smoke Test",
      "position": {
        "x": 80,
        "y": 300
      },
      "width": 500,
      "height": 310,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Graph-Defined Handle Smoke Test\n\nThree nodes expose the same semantic `signal` Port.\n\n1. **HTML** inherits its node Declaration default.\n2. **SVG** overrides that default at the Port.\n3. **Canvas** overrides that default at the Port.\n\nThe authored art remains visible in browse mode. Switch to edit mode and focus a node to verify that the same visual hotspot becomes the connection target."
      }
    },
